# Ghosts: a knob that something moves shows an orange tick at its live value (the x it sits at). The
# Filter page's Breath moves Cutoff from the start; a Mod slot moves Morph; CC5 moves Glide and uses CC depth.
# Knobs nothing moves have none (-1), and turning the route off takes the ghost away.
wait 200
expect view 0
expect ghost1 15
expect acc15_224 1
expect ghost2 -1
expect ghost3 -1
expect ghost4 -1
midi 90 3C 64
breath 0 127 60
wait 200
expect ghost1 48
expect acc48_224 1
expect acc15_224 0
expect stale 0
shot ghost_cutoff.png
# Breath at 0: nothing moves Cutoff
spin K4 -75
wait 100
expect par67 0
expect ghost1 -1
expect stale 0
spin K4 75
# Mod 1: Breath to Morph, +50
tap SEL
spin K1 1
spin K2 3
spin K3 50
tap HOME
tap HOME
expect title Classic
wait 200
expect ghost3 161
expect ghost4 -1
expect stale 0
shot ghost_morph.png
breath 127 0 60
wait 300
expect ghost3 139
# Glide: CC5 adds to it, up to CC depth
tap SEQ
expect ghost1 -1
expect ghost2 68
midi B0 05 7F
wait 100
expect ghost2 77
expect stale 0
shot ghost_glide.png
tap SEQ
expect ghost1 17
# the glide CC off: no ghost on Glide or CC depth
tap SEQ
spin K3 200
wait 100
expect ghost2 -1
midi 80 3C 00
